## 3️⃣ Hardening the Express server

| Concern | Recommended Fix | Code Snippet |
|--------|-----------------|--------------|
| **HTTP headers** | Use **helmet** (sets CSP, HSTS, X‑Frame‑Options, etc.) | `npm i helmet` <br> `app.use(require('helmet')());` |
| **CORS** | Whitelist origins you actually serve. | `npm i cors` <br> ```js\nconst cors = require('cors');\napp.use(cors({ origin: process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS?.split(',') || [] }));\n``` |
| **Rate limiting** | Stop brute‑force/DoS attacks. | `npm i express-rate-limit` <br> ```js\nconst rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');\napp.use(rateLimit({ windowMs: 15*60*1000, max: 100 }));\n``` |
| **Body size** | Limit JSON payloads (e.g., 10 KB). | `app.use(express.json({ limit: '10kb' }));` |
| **Hide Express signature** | Remove `X-Powered-By`. | `app.disable('x-powered-by');` |
| **Enable trust proxy** (if behind a reverse proxy) | Required for correct IP handling in rate limiting / logging. | `app.set('trust proxy', 1);` |
| **Secure cookies** | If you later add sessions, set `httpOnly`, `secure`, `sameSite`. | ```js\nres.cookie('token', token, { httpOnly: true, secure: true, sameSite: 'strict' });\n``` |

**Putting it together (top of app.js):**

```js
require('dotenv').config();               // load .env (never commit secrets)
const express   = require('express');
const helmet    = require('helmet');
const cors      = require('cors');
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');

const app = express();

// ---- Security middleware ----
app.disable('x-powered-by');
app.set('trust proxy', 1);                     // adjust if you aren't behind a proxy
app.use(helmet());                             // sets safe defaults
app.use(
  cors({
    origin: process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS?.split(',') || [], // e.g. "https://myapp.com"
    methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],
  })
);
app.use(
  rateLimit({
    windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes
    max: 100,                 // limit each IP to 100 requests per window
    standardHeaders: true,
    legacyHeaders: false,
  })
);
app.use(express.json({ limit: '10kb' })); // body‑parser with size limit
```

